This distribution adapts the nonlinear compliant inverter implementation in
A-Stable-Invertor-Final. The nonlinear path solver, HuHu tangent and adjoints,
objective aggregation, configuration, output, and validation have been revised.

The Helmholtz filter and parallel MMA algorithm are derived from FEniTop:
https://github.com/missionlab/fenitop
Yingqi Jia, Chao Wang, and Xiaojia Shelly Zhang.
FEniTop: a simple FEniCSx implementation for 2D and 3D topology optimization
supporting parallel computing. Struct Multidisc Optim 67, 140 (2024).
https://doi.org/10.1007/s00158-024-03818-7

